  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 동아리 날! 1학기에는 센서 실험을 위주로 했다면, 2학기에는 정보쌤이 주가 되어서<br>아두이노 센서를 활용한 IoT 집을 만들기로 했다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c985b492349cd04ce66f2d33d650b5eae9e9a91a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c985b492349cd04ce66f2d33d650b5eae9e9a91a\" data-origin-width=\"1888\" data-origin-height=\"899\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">학생들은 합쳐진 집 부분 부분에 파트를 맡아서<br>센서를 활용한 가구? 제품? 들을 만들어서 나중에 조립할 예정이다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b6125a6eab3afc278417d075aaf6de1a42b4a07\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b6125a6eab3afc278417d075aaf6de1a42b4a07\" data-origin-width=\"1789\" data-origin-height=\"887\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">각 조마다 맡은 부분을 직접 손으로 스케치하고<br>이음 AI를 활용하여, 구체적으로 설계도를 만들었다.<br>아이디어 자체는 정보쌤과 내가 함께 짰다.<br>학생들은 서로서로 원하는 주제를 골라갔다.<br><br>1. 침대 무게 감지 안방 자동 소등 장치</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33aaddaf6192108538e0629406569f0a23831009\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/33aaddaf6192108538e0629406569f0a23831009\" data-origin-width=\"1121\" data-origin-height=\"828\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c215ddf3a72526e64a45db63df7e7ed80e18660\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c215ddf3a72526e64a45db63df7e7ed80e18660\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e916e46887b645ab6f9500ef13086346fa0f65d\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e916e46887b645ab6f9500ef13086346fa0f65d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaefa2c9ddaaca32130d95d8f995f7599f045160\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaefa2c9ddaaca32130d95d8f995f7599f045160\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6409087966931f6ca76eb5c307eb1a6b95979705\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6409087966931f6ca76eb5c307eb1a6b95979705\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ef9d7a39fb9f453b6cda5328cf0f515633a76c4\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ef9d7a39fb9f453b6cda5328cf0f515633a76c4\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>2. 수위 감지 센서 활용 스마트팜 물 관리</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc02569dc9df3033615c1a1e03116a09e7d7ec34\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc02569dc9df3033615c1a1e03116a09e7d7ec34\" data-origin-width=\"1117\" data-origin-height=\"820\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e25f77db4bdf3e8d86c262d2a46accec8a51da20\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e25f77db4bdf3e8d86c262d2a46accec8a51da20\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/059b861acc98d05f7f6701c1e16182433417c5b1\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/059b861acc98d05f7f6701c1e16182433417c5b1\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83911ae78e0ae0e840292a904794b6935ea5c98f\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83911ae78e0ae0e840292a904794b6935ea5c98f\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>3. 미세먼지 센서 활용 집안 연기 감지</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47c5eb3f87e7f3d17516c495e6dbc0fc0752fbc4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47c5eb3f87e7f3d17516c495e6dbc0fc0752fbc4\" data-origin-width=\"1115\" data-origin-height=\"816\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73d14ca3b52abbee60852ae6bc1fd5b4d78d3dde\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73d14ca3b52abbee60852ae6bc1fd5b4d78d3dde\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d01fd2baf2139ca92330e7937c0f28a9ad73c67b\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d01fd2baf2139ca92330e7937c0f28a9ad73c67b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3307c7f0bf97fe29e9eeadbd6598b3a9b7695d72\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:33.33%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3307c7f0bf97fe29e9eeadbd6598b3a9b7695d72\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>4. 밝기 센서 활용 자동 물 따르기 장치</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49839e04d44d661df9b11cb2033c5c2653aca4a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49839e04d44d661df9b11cb2033c5c2653aca4a5\" data-origin-width=\"1120\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c39f7cf580120a7d464ed4613023cfbc72395f24\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c39f7cf580120a7d464ed4613023cfbc72395f24\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57588541932793ec79404f907c508333a3e10a0d\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57588541932793ec79404f907c508333a3e10a0d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>5. 온습도 센서 활용 선풍기 자동 작동기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/575ccdee7738ba87617103fcd353f396d44802de\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/575ccdee7738ba87617103fcd353f396d44802de\" data-origin-width=\"1111\" data-origin-height=\"814\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0822789fd063fa044affd25c0a6dfa31faa59763\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0822789fd063fa044affd25c0a6dfa31faa59763\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>6. 무게 센서 활용 현관 센서등</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbbed2e31e32607cc41ee4fdca467a5acc2af404\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbbed2e31e32607cc41ee4fdca467a5acc2af404\" data-origin-width=\"1117\" data-origin-height=\"812\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69c78410d65d26fddb4639859d02aff66fbf26c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69c78410d65d26fddb4639859d02aff66fbf26c7\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 우드락으로 겉껍데기까지만 만들었고<br>다음 동아리 시간에는 아두이노 센서를 준비 및 코딩해서, 조립하고 색칠하는 시간을 가져보려 한다!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<a href=\"\nhttps://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><br></a><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-